<title>SPAIN: Spain convergence efforts deserve applause - Issing.</title>
<headline>Spain convergence efforts deserve applause - Issing.</headline>
<dateline>PAMPLONA, Spain 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank board member Otmar Issing said on Thursday that Spain's convergence efforts were worthy of praise.</p>
<p>Issing, speaking to journalists following a speech to bankers in this northern Spanish town, said &quot;Spain has made a lot of effort which deserve the applause of everyone.&quot;</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
